Star mandala pattern

+++++ +++++                     cell 0 is 10 (row counter)
[
    >++++++++[>+++++<-]>++.     star (42)
    [-]<[-]<                    clear scratch cells

    >++++[>++++++++<-]>..       two spaces (32)
    [-]<[-]<                    clear scratch cells

    >++++++++[>+++++<-]>++.     star (42)
    [-]<[-]<                    clear scratch cells

    >++++++++++.                newline (10)
    [-]<                        clear scratch cell

    -                           decrement row counter
]

Final centered star
>++++++++[>+++++<-]>++.         star (42)
[-]<[-]
>++++++++++.                    newline (10)
